{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_spuria_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_spuria_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"铳声回响","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_spuria_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"3219f4984ba4f4c34fa75d432f7a402b894171b8f0aeda33164c9031d3b2d200","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g6_laterano_chapelin"},{"type":"narration","text":"1099年5月\n拉特兰，安魂教堂"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的拉特兰人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，你带的炸药挺不错嘛！如果老先生在棺材里还能听到的话，一定会很开心的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"矜持的拉特兰人","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？那就好。我听说他离世前一周还参加了养老院的爆破竞速赛，所以我想他会喜欢的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，不会吧，今天来参加葬礼的人居然这么多？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为你见到我的时候会更开心一些哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，只是觉得......这里离城区还挺远的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没办法，毕竟是教过我们的老师的葬礼，菲亚梅塔和莫斯提马又不在拉特兰，只好我代她们来啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，是因为公务来的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"养老院那些不方便行动的老人想看葬礼的现场直播，这种时候肯定就会找上我们部门，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你已经适应教皇厅的工作了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然啦，我可是一直努力想追上学姐啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是啊，莉雅，我不是你的老师，并不能给你的作品打分哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉，真希望我们不是都有光环。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然那样也很难逃过学姐的眼睛就是了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的拉特兰人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，我记得你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的拉特兰人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师给我们展示过你的爆炸物设计作业！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，居然不是因为违纪被她抓住吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那应该主要是菲亚梅塔的功劳吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，这位老师教我们的时候就已经快一百岁了，但那时他还很有精神呢，声音也很洪亮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的拉特兰人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，老师是这两年才离开学校安心养老的，毕竟他是真的很喜欢研究爆炸物嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的拉特兰人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且学校离他最喜欢的甜品店也比较近，还没有人管着他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的拉特兰人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......老师在遗嘱里说自己已经了无遗憾，但我还是会想到，他再也吃不到季节限定新品仙人掌挞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，我闻到伤感的气息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的拉特兰人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，不好意思......老师终于回归崇高圣灵的时刻，我怎么能想仙人掌挞的事情呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的拉特兰人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该把保险栓拉开了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的拉特兰人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，还是爆炸声适合葬礼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"热情的拉特兰人","speakerId":"avg_npc_366_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要去那边的空地上来个三连发射击！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那我也去维持秩序......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了，莉雅，不再聊一会儿吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说我住院的时候，你可是坚持不懈地向小乐打听了一年多，才要到我的病房号呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，学姐真可怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也只是想关心一下你嘛。毕竟准确来说，我现在已经不能算你的“学姐”了哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我睡觉的时间里，你应该看到了很多东西，经历了很多事情才对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_npc_925_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莉雅，你有推开门去看看吗？有让技术更好地为人所用吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真狡猾啊，学姐，明知道这其实是我想问你的问题。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也许吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g8_laterano_dwelling"},{"type":"narration","text":"1100年1月\n拉特兰，可露丽大街，某处民居"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我现在算是长期外派人员了，绝不在教皇厅里多待一分钟的那种。安布罗修修道院的修复工作，我这边可帮不上忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就这样，我这边还有事呢，先挂断咯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"熟悉的源石火药味，熟悉的爆破实验声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"简直就和以前逃课跑来这里的时候一模一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那座修道院里发生过的事情，在这里回想起来，总觉得很不真实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难怪那些历史学得好的家伙喜欢把“长存的乐园”挂在嘴边......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真可怕啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，人不在吗？门上明明挂着“欢迎光临”的牌子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真没劲！你怎么就把我的小机关烧短路了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会吧，阿玛丽大师，您就是这么欢迎客人的吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳械维修师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是发射一团奶油而已，你要是反应够快，可以刚好用嘴接住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我是工匠欸，又不是训练用的循兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳械维修师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵。坐吧，斯普莉雅。有什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我手里有一把铳要改造。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳械维修师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，一把老古董。"},{"type":"narration","text":"铳的持有者......\n不是萨科塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她想要用铳，结果却造成了走火的情况。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这把铳对她来说还挺重要的，所以我答应她，她可以把铳留在身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——当然，要等我改造一下才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，但是要让其他种族的人也能用铳，这可是个大难题啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳械维修师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好，我这里也有位客人，给了我一把走了火的铳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳械维修师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不如先拿这个找找灵感吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不就是一把普通的铳嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，好吧，看在我们的关系上，我当然愿意帮您干活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳械维修师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，我听说你被从城区办事处提拔到教皇厅了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不会吧，您这么不关心自己的朋友吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳械维修师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没去教皇厅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去了，而且刚刚提了辞职。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然没辞职成功，只是拿到了一个长期外派人员的身份，不过至少不用跟我那位唠叨的上司每天坐在一个办公室里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳械维修师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就说啦，当一个工匠更适合你。是不是又惹事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是的，我还以为自己在城区办事处这几年遇到的麻烦事已经够多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结果，我还是没当成一个好工匠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳械维修师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真可惜，我还指望你以后每次来看望我都带点教皇厅门口的子弹头饼干，省得我自己点外卖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳械维修师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，之前你用来捉弄去办事处的小孩子的几个发明，我确实很喜欢——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳械维修师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——哦，你手里那把铳的主人来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨科塔顾客","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，对铳械这么疏于保养可是会出问题的哦。你看，这把铳的阻铁有些磨损，我们得换个新的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，还得再加一重保险机制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨科塔顾客","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给您添麻烦了。不过，我的女儿只有三岁，她想要的可能不是这些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨科塔顾客","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然她偷偷折腾我的铳导致了走火，但她想要的其实是商场里能喷出彩虹糖的玩具铳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨科塔顾客","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我希望能将这把铳改成她想要的样子，作为她的出院礼物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨科塔顾客","speakerId":"avg_npc_368_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——啊，您不用担心，铳虽然走火了，但我的女儿和丈夫都没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好......你们还是挺幸运的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拜托，阿玛丽大师，您怎么没有提前告诉我这个客人想要什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳械维修师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你不是也没有告诉我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铳械维修师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个人如果不是萨科塔，为什么一定要用铳？这不是很奇怪吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说得对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，我该去直接问问她了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_g6_villagestreet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......天真冷啊，我们必须快点把这块挡风板钉好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕克，可以来搭把手吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕克？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕克","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别跟他浪费时间了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......因为是我在叫他，所以他不会答应？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在谁这么叫他，他都不答应，就因为这个名字是你提议的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天打猎的时候，我会给他点教训的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样不好，莱蒙德，我不想再跟人吵架了，更不希望用上武力......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道......但前提是，他能好好地跟人说话，而不是这么一声不吭地瞪着你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他到底有没有搞清楚，是你救了他！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，在吵架？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——咳，晚上好，斯普莉雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们收到你的信了，但其实你不用提前通知，我们实在没什么可以准备的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，之前说好的青草格子饼，我也做不出来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正巧，我匿名联系了一支商队，他们很快就会绕路到这里来跟你们做生意。"},{"type":"narration","text":"商队？！\n太好了，斯普莉雅......这下我们能在冬天里多坚持一段时间了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，确实是救命的物资，谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"福尔图娜，到时候你躲好，我来交易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"见商队的时候戴好兜帽，还有，别被骗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......我知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，斯普莉雅......还有一件事我必须向你道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说过我的样子不能让太多人看到，尤其是其他萨卡兹，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别担心，我们先进屋，你再慢慢交代。说不好我不会生气哦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，那个年轻萨卡兹就是你们新收留的成员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，按照教皇厅给我的守则，这算是违反律法的行为吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对、对不起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，毕竟他是受了伤被你们救回来的，教宗那么和蔼的老爷爷应该能理解吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，你说他原本跟着一支队伍去卡兹戴尔，但是因为受伤掉队了，那支队伍里的人也不会再接纳他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那看来他只能定居在这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我希望他留下来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要他不到处乱跑，这里有堕天使的消息就不会散播出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，写报告也很麻烦，要不就在报告里隐瞒这件事好啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？太好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......这样没问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说不定会有哦，所以下次别再犯了，好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，你一直戴好兜帽，永远不拿出你的铳，这样也可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......我会试着去做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经在学着用手弩了，最近几次狩猎，我也跟着去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很难......啊，我不是说使用手弩很难，而是要维持生活很难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过去在修道院里，我总是相信，虔诚祈祷之人自然会领到他的圣餐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在我仍然会和苏拉尔还有其他几个人一起祈祷，但我们都知道事情变得不一样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，只是提醒一下你，记得你的身份，不要说出相关的概念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，我记得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你受到的影响大吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然失去了共感能力，但你身边本来也没有别的萨科塔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，我越来越清晰地感觉到自己失去了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像一直在走夜路。盲目，感觉不到其他人......孤独。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我知道，这片黑暗我永远也走不出去了，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，抱歉，这些应该不是写报告需要的内容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，我还是挺乐意听的哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，你的这把铳我还没改造完呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"福尔图娜，你想要拿这把铳做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还是很害怕它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我必须握住它，我不能就这么放下菲娜的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稍等一下，福尔图娜。我想欢迎一位客人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕克","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别躲在窗户底下了，我的无人机盯着你很久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不要这么紧张嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看得出来，你在怀疑我们萨科塔会联合起来做什么对萨卡兹不利的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然这样，为什么不进来旁听？外面那么冷，进屋少吹点风也不坏吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕克","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们绝对没有想伤害你的意思，帕克。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，我们继续说你的事吧。只要把事情说清楚，没有共感的人也能互相理解吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还要改你的铳呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我想战胜自己的恐惧，找回一些安心的感觉，就像以前我握住铳的时候得到的回应那样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且来到这里之后，我总是想，要是能把那种感觉分享给其他人就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为......以前主教爷爷总是能安慰每一个去找他的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我们已经离开他了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你竟然开始动手改了。我这样的想法，不会很无理取闹吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可没说我会照着你的愿望来改哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我确实有了一些灵感。等我改好，可别忘了感谢我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，现在几点钟了？昨晚我又是几点钟才改好那把铳的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯普莉雅，斯普莉雅......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起......对不起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"铳......不见了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，帕克也不见了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wild_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨晚放哨的人都没看见他......该死的，那家伙清楚大家换岗的习惯，我们也没想过要防自己人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，斯普莉雅，我们一定把他抓回来，已经有一队人准备出发了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别这么着急嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可是我改造的武器，它去了哪里，我还是心里有数的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你从一开始就提防他了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以猜猜我有没有提防小福尔图娜跑掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——开玩笑的，总之，你们不用这么紧张，放轻松一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和福尔图娜两个人去追他就够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，还有一件事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喔，虽然对外派人员的资材消耗统计很宽松，但监管堕天使的任务里用掉的子弹还是要上报，所以我会宽容一些的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是想听到这句话吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱蒙德","speakerId":"avg_npc_931_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，多谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里有血迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯普莉雅......真的是这个方向吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少你的铳一定在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说你已经把铳改好了，即使是我也能用，那帕克是不是也可以？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是很希望他会试试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那......这是谁的血？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......哈，哈哈哈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕克","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不就是你们想看的吗，该死的萨科塔！这是我的血！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情况糟糕啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帕克......！这、这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是被野兽撕裂的伤口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕克","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴......给我滚开！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕克","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死在牙兽嘴里，也好过死在你们的圈套里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圈套？怎么会！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明听到我们在聊什么了......我们不想伤害任何人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯普莉雅还帮大家弄到了过冬的物资！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕克","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，你们就是用这种方式骗其他萨卡兹留下来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕克","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们为什么不回家？除了卡兹戴尔，萨卡兹怎么可能有别的家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡兹戴尔......究竟是什么地方？莱蒙德从来没有告诉我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......福尔图娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有去过安布罗修修道院的人，恐怕是很难理解你们的生活方式的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......不去想那么多，只是住在这里，有一个安稳过冬的屋檐，不好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕克","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不去想那么多？咳、咳咳......你骗不了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕克","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这帮顶着光环的混蛋，一辈子都在骗人，一辈子都在装圣人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕克","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们不可能不恨萨卡兹，你们只是在等一个好机会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕克","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......一对萨卡兹的角，值多少钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我不知道！我真的不知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......看来，你偷走福尔图娜的铳，是出于类似的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕克","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕克","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早知道我会死，我就该先把你们的头割下来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......先把它还回来吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕克","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......别拿走它！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"帕克","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一把萨科塔的铳，足够我回到队伍......被尊重......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是这把“铳”我已经改造过了，它根本就......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g11_laterano_alley"},{"type":"narration","text":"“偷走遗产铳可是非常严重的违背律法的行为哦，斯普莉雅，就算你说那是老师上课的教具也没用。”\n“不过，老师们也很好奇，你这个一节课都没听的天才，究竟能从一把铳上研究出什么。”\n“是哦，遗产铳都是些老古董，轻轻松松就能拆解。”\n“再怎么翻来覆去地看，能看到的也只有两种技术。一种我们现代人根本用不上，另一种则是基础中的基础。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“但是，莉雅，你有试过握住它祈祷吗？”\n“或者说，你能想象是什么人，在什么情形下曾握住它祈祷吗？”\n“那时圣城尚未建起，世上还没有乐园......很难想象吧？”\n“可是如果不去理解那样的时代，你要怎么研究他们的遗产呢？”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯普莉雅，你怎么......突然开火？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯普莉雅维持着将自己的铳指向洞口空旷处的姿势，又一次扣动扳机。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别紧张嘛，只是......拉特兰人就是这样办葬礼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死亡的沉重也好，别离的痛苦也好，遗憾和愤怒也好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全都能被热闹的爆炸声冲淡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"没有第二名萨科塔的铳声，没有连环爆炸，没有尖叫和大笑。\n在一声又一声的铳响之中，福尔图娜深吸了一口气，从斯普莉雅手中拿过了自己的那把铳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以保证，它现在绝对安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是害怕的话，你可以闭上眼睛。我会帮你看着的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我应该看着，然后记住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，闭上眼睛。手臂朝着这个方向......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"福尔图娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_927_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，这把“铳”已经当不了战利品了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯普莉雅","speakerId":"avg_4015_spuria_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它已经不是铳了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不需要萨科塔的射击天赋也能使用，能够分享简单的快乐。\n五颜六色的纸片和彩带从铳口喷出，挂在两人的头发上。\n铳声回荡着，彩色的碎屑纷纷飘落。\n只是在场的人脸上，都没有笑容。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
